{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just\/broadcast()"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just\/broadcast()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE9broadcastAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO4JustV","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"broadcast","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L68"},"role":"symbol","title":"broadcast()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"broadcast","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"multiple consumers that iterate concurrently. Each consumer sees the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence of elements, and elements are only fetched once from the upstream","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"broadcast","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" creates a new shared sequence that manages buffering and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distribution of elements to all active iterators. A consumer receives the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"broadcast"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"share"},{"text":" operators are functionally equivalent and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be used interchangeably.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.broadcast()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"title":"Afluent","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Just":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Just","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AsyncSequences.Just","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An async sequence that emits a single specified element and then completes."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Just","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","title":"AsyncSequences","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Just/broadcast()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just\/broadcast()","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just\/broadcast()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"broadcast"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"title":"broadcast()"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"ki